      "problem": "Find the right-sided limit at $x=-4$ of the piecewise function $f(x)$ defined by\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}-16\\, & \\text{ for }\\,x\\le -4 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\, & \\text{ for }\\,x>-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
